 "examples": {
  "none": "Subject: Availability for Cherry Shipments Jun\u2013Aug  \n\nHi Dana,  \n\nI hope you're doing well. My name is [Your Name], and I'm with Lanebridge Logistics. We specialize in asset-light truckload brokerage with a vetted carrier network, and we\u2019re reaching out because we noticed your cherry shipping season is approaching.  \n\nWe have reefer capacity available out of the WA area and can provide quotes for your shipments. Given the timing, we wanted to connect and see if you\u2019d be open to a quick 15-minute call next week to discuss how we can support your needs.  \n\nLet me know a time that works for you.  \n\nBest,  \n[Your Name]  \nLanebridge Logistics",
  "vec12": "Subject:  Re:  Capacity for Cherry Shipments\n\nDear Ms.  Dana,\n\nI am the account executive for Lanebridge Logistics.  I have  been  directed  to  contact  you  in  regard  to  the  cherry  shipments  which  you  will  make  from  Yakima  during  June  through  August.  Lanebridge  has  no  prior  relationship  with  you,  but  has  been  directed  to  contact  you  in  this  regard.\n\nLanebridge  is  an  asset  light  broker  which  has  a  reefer  capacity  available  in  the  WA  area.  It  is  the  only  such  capacity  which  is  available  to  be  quoted  in  such  a  manner.  Therefore,  the  only  way  to  proceed  is  to  have  such  capacity  quoted  to  you  by  the  carrier  in  the  same  manner  as  the  other  such  capacity  is  quoted  to  the  other  such  person.\n\nTherefore,  the  only  way  to  proceed  is  to  have  such  capacity  quoted  to  you  by  the  carrier  in  the  same  manner  as  the  other  such  capacity  is  quoted  to  the  other  such  person.  Therefore,  the",
  "lora12": "Dana,\n\nI hope you're well.\n\nAs the cherries shipping season is approaching, I wanted to reach out to see if there's an opportunity for Lanebridge Logistics to support your shipments. We specialize in asset-light truckload brokerage with a vetted carrier network and can quote reefer capacity out of the WA area.\n\nWe\u2019d love to connect and discuss further, so if you\u2019re available, I\u2019d like to set up a 15-minute call next week at your convenience.\n\nThanks for your time, and I look forward to connecting.\n\nBest,  \n[Your Name]",
  "shot8": "Dana,\n\nI hope you're doing well. My name is [name], and I'm an account executive with Lanebridge Logistics. We're reaching out as your cherry shipping season is approaching, typically from June to August, and we wanted to connect about potential truckload capacity for your shipments.\n\nWe specialize in asset-light truckload brokerage with a vetted carrier network and can provide reefer capacity out of the Washington area. Given the timing, we thought it would be helpful to schedule a quick 15-minute call next week to discuss your needs and how we can support your shipping schedule.\n\nPlease let me know a time that works for you, and I'll make sure to block it off. Looking forward to speaking with you soon.\n\nThanks,  \n[name]  \nLanebridge Logistics"
 }
